    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you survive in the wild northern Hispania of the 1st century BC? Step into the sandals of a Roman legionnaire in Summa Expeditionis: a survival, base building and strategy game. You have been sent to the last corner of the Empire and your mission is to go into uncharted territory, establish a fortified camp and grow enough to subdue these unruly barbarians.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056200/extras/df4ce187499628067992cf93ed521c93.poster.avif?t=1750351004\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056200/extras/df4ce187499628067992cf93ed521c93.webm?t=1750351004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056200/extras/df4ce187499628067992cf93ed521c93.mp4?t=1750351004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Do you have what it takes to become a legend of Rome?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a legionary, your mission is clear: <strong>expand the Empire's borders</strong> into hostile lands. Build your camp, manage resources, face barbarian tribes, and rise through the ranks to become a true military leader.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfd5\ufe0f <strong>Survival and Management</strong> \u2013 Gather resources, build settlements, and secure supplies for your troops. <br>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Customization and Progression</strong> \u2013 Upgrade your gear, train soldiers, and adapt your strategy to conquer new lands.<br>\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Strategic Combat</strong> \u2013 Engage in intense tactical battles against ruthless enemies. <br>\ud83c\udf0d <strong>A Dynamic and Unique World</strong> \u2013 Every game is different thanks to <strong>procedural generation</strong>, ensuring new challenges and opportunities in each expedition.<br>\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f <strong>Historical Authenticity</strong> \u2013 Experience ancient Rome with stunning realism, from military equipment to dialogues in Latin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summa Expeditionis is more than a game: <strong>it\u2019s a test of wit, courage, and leadership</strong>. Will you answer Rome\u2019s call?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Play now in Early Access and help shape the ultimate Roman Empire experience!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056200/extras/eab21620cc9902e0a3a69490cfe280b6.poster.avif?t=1750351004\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056200/extras/eab21620cc9902e0a3a69490cfe280b6.webm?t=1750351004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056200/extras/eab21620cc9902e0a3a69490cfe280b6.mp4?t=1750351004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you survive in the wild northern Hispania of the 1st century BC? Step into the sandals of a Roman legionnaire in Summa Expeditionis: a survival, base building and strategy game. You have been sent to the last corner of the Empire and your mission is to go into uncharted territory, establish a fortified camp and grow enough to subdue these unruly barbarians.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056200/extras/df4ce187499628067992cf93ed521c93.poster.avif?t=1750351004\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056200/extras/df4ce187499628067992cf93ed521c93.webm?t=1750351004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056200/extras/df4ce187499628067992cf93ed521c93.mp4?t=1750351004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Do you have what it takes to become a legend of Rome?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a legionary, your mission is clear: <strong>expand the Empire's borders</strong> into hostile lands. Build your camp, manage resources, face barbarian tribes, and rise through the ranks to become a true military leader.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfd5\ufe0f <strong>Survival and Management</strong> \u2013 Gather resources, build settlements, and secure supplies for your troops. <br>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Customization and Progression</strong> \u2013 Upgrade your gear, train soldiers, and adapt your strategy to conquer new lands.<br>\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Strategic Combat</strong> \u2013 Engage in intense tactical battles against ruthless enemies. <br>\ud83c\udf0d <strong>A Dynamic and Unique World</strong> \u2013 Every game is different thanks to <strong>procedural generation</strong>, ensuring new challenges and opportunities in each expedition.<br>\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f <strong>Historical Authenticity</strong> \u2013 Experience ancient Rome with stunning realism, from military equipment to dialogues in Latin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summa Expeditionis is more than a game: <strong>it\u2019s a test of wit, courage, and leadership</strong>. Will you answer Rome\u2019s call?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Play now in Early Access and help shape the ultimate Roman Empire experience!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056200/extras/eab21620cc9902e0a3a69490cfe280b6.poster.avif?t=1750351004\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056200/extras/eab21620cc9902e0a3a69490cfe280b6.webm?t=1750351004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056200/extras/eab21620cc9902e0a3a69490cfe280b6.mp4?t=1750351004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
